WEBVTT

00:00:56.901 --> 00:01:00.173
which I really was appalled by.

00:01:00.197 --> 00:01:02.600
(Laughter)

00:01:02.624 --> 00:01:05.976
And because I wanted
to impress you all with slides,

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.738
since I saw the great presentations
yesterday with graphs,

00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:11.080
I made a graph that moves,

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.976
and I talk about the makeup of me.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.346
(Laughter)

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.423
So, besides this freakish thing,

00:01:19.447 --> 00:01:20.699
this is my science slide.

00:01:20.723 --> 00:01:23.291
This is math, and this is science,
this is genetics.

00:01:23.315 --> 00:01:26.187
This is my grandmother,
and this is where I get this mouth.

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:28.159
(Laughter)

00:01:28.183 --> 00:01:29.439
So --